# Trivy ignore list — every entry needs a justification and a rotation
# condition. Remove entries as soon as the upstream fix ships.
#
# Currently empty. The previous three entries (CVE-2026-41567,
# CVE-2026-42306, CVE-2026-34040 — docker/docker v28.5.2 embedded in pack
# 0.40.7) were rotated out on 2026-07-11: pack (and the docker CLI) are no
# longer present in any published/scanned image. They now live only in the
# unpublished dev-only stages (apps/switchyard-api/Dockerfile `dev`,
# apps/roundhouse/Dockerfile `worker-dev`), which CI does not scan.

# CVE-2025-71329, CVE-2025-71330 — image-size 2.0.2, transitive via
# Docusaurus 3.10.2 (docs-site ONLY; no published service image carries it).
# NO upstream fix exists as of 2026-08-27: image-size has no patched release
# and Docusaurus pins the range. Justification: docs-site is an internal
# documentation surface, not a production service path; the findings are
# parser-DoS class reachable only by building the site from hostile images,
# which our build does not do. Rotation condition: remove the moment
# image-size ships a fix or Docusaurus bumps past it — re-check on every
# Docusaurus upgrade, and no later than 2026-10-01.
CVE-2025-71329
CVE-2025-71330

# CVE-2026-53612, CVE-2026-53613, CVE-2026-53614, CVE-2026-76642,
# CVE-2026-78408, CVE-2026-78409, CVE-2026-78410 — util-linux 2.42.1-r0,
# reported against `libuuid` in the docs-site image (runner stage is
# nginx:alpine on Alpine 3.24.1). Every one of the seven is a defect in
# mount(8)/nsenter(1) — TOCTOU in the mount program, LIBMOUNT_FORCE_MOUNT2,
# X-mount post-hooks, --join-cgroup, X-mount.subdir, restricted bind mounts.
# The docs-site image carries NEITHER binary: only libuuid.so (UUID
# generation for nginx) is installed from the util-linux source package, and
# the image runs a static nginx behind the tunnel with no mount namespace to
# escape. Trivy names the fix as 2.42.3-r0, but as of 2026-09-05 the Alpine
# v3.24 main index still publishes 2.42.1-r0, so `apk upgrade --no-cache`
# (already in the Dockerfile) cannot pull it. Rotation condition: remove the
# moment Alpine 3.24 ships util-linux >= 2.42.3-r0 — check on every docs-site
# rebuild, and no later than 2026-10-01.
CVE-2026-53612
CVE-2026-53613
CVE-2026-53614
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
CVE-2026-78410
